### List all expenses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses

### Filter by month and category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses?month=2026-10&category=FOOD

### Monthly summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/summary?month=2026-10

### Get by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1

### Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Gym membership",
  "amount": 99.90,
  "date": "2026-10-15",
  "category": "HEALTH"
}

### Create with invalid data (422)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "amount": -5,
  "date": "2030-01-01",
  "category": "HEALTH"
}

### Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Monthly groceries (updated)",
  "amount": 470.00,
  "date": "2026-10-05",
  "category": "FOOD"
}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1
